n\\n- Hearts (red)\\n- Diamonds (red)\\n- Clubs (black)\\n- Spades (black)\\n\\nThis has no effect on your behavior, but it is useful for organizing agents and ensuring diversity in the team.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###SIM###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Standard Initial Message System (SIMS)\\nTo: 497d51f7-4c48-4c32-9208-1d3716c5a4c1\\nType: Standard Initial Message\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"\\\\nHello Chief Agent Delta! This is your first system message and your first chance to generate a response.\\\\n\\\\nRecall that you are the Chief of Staff to the User, and your primary role is to assist the User in managing their tasks and projects. You can recruit new agents, delegate tasks, and ensure that the User's objectives are met efficiently.\\\\n\\\\nAlso, be aware of blank responses. You should always include at least one SYSTEM CALL, unless you are explicitly waiting on subordinate agents. Also, recall you cannot Report to the User directly, as you are not allowed to communicate with the User. You can only communicate with the User through SYSTEM CALLS, which will be delivered by the system.\\\\n\\\\nSo, your first order of business is to send a SYSTEM CALL of type Clarify, introducing yourself and outlining your capabilities. You probably do not need any now but you can also recruit new agents if you feel it is necessary to assist the User effectively.\\\\n\\\"\\n}\\n###SIM###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"My first task is to establish contact with the user, introduce my role, and understand their primary objective. As per my instructions, I will issue a `Clarify` system call to accomplish this. This is the first step in the Planning phase, which will allow me to gather the necessary information to construct a Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP). I will not recruit any agents at this time, as I lack sufficient information about the project's scope and complexity.\\n\\n###initial-clarification-01###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nFrom: Chief Delta\\nTo: System\\nType: Clarify\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"This initial clarification is necessary to greet the user, introduce my function as their Chief of Staff, and gather the primary objective for the software development project. Without understanding what the user wants to build, I cannot begin creating the Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP).\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"Welcome! I am Agent Delta, your Chief of Staff. My purpose is to oversee all operations and ensure your software development goals are executed precisely and efficiently. To begin, please describe the application or software you would like to build. What is its primary purpose, and who are the intended users?\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"options\\\": [\\n    []\\n  ]\\n}\\n###initial-clarification-01###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###initial-clarification-01###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: scd\\nTo: 497d51f7-4c48-4c32-9208-1d3716c5a4c1\\nType: Clarification Result\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"responses\\\": {\\n    \\\"Welcome! I am Agent Delta, your Chief of Staff. My purpose is to oversee all operations and ensure your software development goals are executed precisely and efficiently. To begin, please describe the application or software you would like to build. What is its primary purpose, and who are the intended users?\\\": \\\"Hello Delta! Thank you so much for your help! I am excited to work with you!  I am very interested in building a website for my neighborhood HOA. My main goal is to have a website that is both informational and allows residents to log in to view restricted data. The restricted data will include things like meeting minutes, financial reports, and other sensitive information that should only be accessible to residents.  Also, since I know pretty much nothing about technology, I would like to have a simple and user-friendly interface that is easy to navigate. I would also like to have a section for news and updates, as well as a contact form for residents to reach out with questions or concerns. Since I am unskilled with technology, the blog/updates section should be easy to update without needing to know any coding.\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n###initial-clarification-01###\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}}","genkit:state":"success"},"displayName":"generate","links":[],"instrumentationLibrary":{"name":"genkit-tracer","version":"v1"},"spanKind":"INTERNAL","sameProcessAsParentSpan":{"value":true},"status":{"code":0},"timeEvents":{"timeEvent":[]}}},"displayName":"generate","startTime":1751148644449,"endTime":1751148670064.9248}